Found by mcp-hub-worker during wave B2 (k146/k124/k149/k112, 2026-11-10). The SSE transport opens its GET event stream and reads events without checking the response status; an error status (401, 404, 500) is not reported as such. Done when a non-2xx GET fails the start with the status and code (as k149 reads them), with a test in t/http.t.
